alculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Lyon County runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, while April to May and June to July each did it in 30. In 2025, July to August hit 182% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 January to February came in at 30%. Grid 29536 had its driest year in 1976 at 44% of normal.</p>"}
